    <text>
        <body>
            <div>
                <head>Translated parts</head>
                <p xml:id="KR6q0003-start">
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_015-0317b.49" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:24:09.528+09:00">「Hé bù guīlái? 」 "Why not return?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_015-0317b.50" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:24:09.528+09:00">Shī duì yuē︰ The master replied:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_015-0317b.51" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:24:09.528+09:00">「Hēi. 」 "Dark."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_015-0317b.52" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:24:09.528+09:00">Lóng nǎi diǎn zhú yǔ shī， Lóng then lit a candle and gave it to the master.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_015-0317b.53" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:24:09.528+09:00">Shī nǐ jiē， The master intended to take it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_015-0317b.54" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:24:09.528+09:00">Lóng biàn chuī miè， but Lóng immediately blew it out.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_015-0317b.55" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:24:09.528+09:00">Shī nǎi lǐbài。 The master then bowed in reverence.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_015-0317b.56" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:24:09.528+09:00">Lóng yuē︰ Lóng said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_015-0317b.57" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:24:09.528+09:00">「Jiàn shénme? 」 "What did you see?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_015-0317b.58" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:24:09.528+09:00">Yuē︰ He said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_015-0317b.59" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:24:09.528+09:00">「Cóng jīn xiàng qù， "From this point forward,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_015-0317b.60" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:24:09.528+09:00">bù yí tiānxià lǎo héshang shétou yě。 」 I will not doubt the tongues of the old monks in the world."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_015-0317b.61" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:24:09.528+09:00">Zhì míngrì， The next day,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_015-0317b.62" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:24:09.528+09:00">biàn fā。 he departed.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_015-0317b.63" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:24:09.528+09:00">Lóngtán wèi zhū tú yuē︰ Lóngtán said to his disciples:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_015-0317b.64" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:24:09.528+09:00">「Kě zhōng yǒu yī gè hàn， "Among you there is a man,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_015-0317b.65" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:24:09.528+09:00">yá rú jiàn shù， whose teeth are like a forest of swords,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_015-0317b.66" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:24:09.528+09:00">kǒu sì xuè pén， and whose mouth is like a blood basin.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_015-0317b.67" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:24:09.528+09:00">yī bàng dǎ bù huítóu， One strike of the staff will not make him turn his head back.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_015-0317b.68" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:24:09.528+09:00">tāshí xiàng gū fēng dǐng shàng lì wú dào zài。 」 In the future, he will establish my Way on the peak of a solitary peak."</seg>
                </p>
            </div>
        </body>
